# Deny by default. The image needs exactly one file, so the context is one file.
# A deny list ("ignore src, ignore build, ignore .gradle...") has to be extended for every directory
# anyone adds later, and the day it is not, the context quietly grows or a secret rides along.
# An allow list of one cannot go stale. BuildKit reads the Dockerfile outside the context, so the
# leading * does not hide it.
*
!app.jar
